cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "APPalti — PU Learning for Fraud Detection in Italian Public Procurement"
abstract: >
  Machine learning pipeline implementing Positive-Unlabeled (PU) learning to detect
  fraud in Italian public procurement contracts. Uses ANAC microdata (2008-2025)
  covering approximately 9.5 million contracts. Implements multiple PU model families
  (risk estimators, bagging, biased, EM-like), prior estimation, calibration, and
  conformal prediction.
